*** Collaborative LaTeX Manuscript Editor\n(real-time editing, compile,\ntracked suggestions)\n«new» <<new>>
*** GitHub Repository Connection\nfor Manuscripts\n«new» <<new>>
legend right
  <back:#FFD54F>  <b>«new»</b>  </back> = new sub-feature (thick red outline)
